4879fb39143b","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"2c20ecf4-0d3d-4b18-85b8-65431fccd3cc","pageSectionCanonId":"4b156b7e-1b18-4194-847c-2ec918f6ce28","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"c2b491fc-9d0f-41da-a418-46bda3408487","pageContentChunkCanonId":"e81351d6-44a5-4028-8067-f2248bf825b2","htmlValue":"<h2>使用基于内容的颜色进行设计</h2>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-05-08T13:30:10.188Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"e3edce53-5c02-497e-912d-e2aafa250a0e","pageContentBlockCanonId":"6612fe8c-5eff-4b93-ac8b-54078f759e81","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"2c20ecf4-0d3d-4b18-85b8-65431fccd3cc","pageSectionCanonId":"4b156b7e-1b18-4194-847c-2ec918f6ce28","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"95a83044-5075-4eb9-9e62-992f06eba505","pageContentChunkCanonId":"9dfded3a-fd6d-4d42-8376-2d699988bf31","htmlValue":"<ul><li>在能够增强品牌识别度并传达个性化精神的应用和区域中应用内容颜色。 </li><li>例如，音乐应用可以从特定专辑的封面提取颜色，以强化用户与音乐库之间的个人情感联结。对于新闻信息流，可以基于特定出版物应用基于内容的颜色，以区分品牌并帮助用户在平台中进行导航。</li><li>应用内内容为任何基于内容的配色方案提供颜色来源，并可应用于应用的指定区域，例如一组组件或特定屏幕。</li><li>开始使用：使用 Theme Builder 内置的颜色 token 和角色。使用 <a href=\"https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1034969338659738588/material-theme-builder\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Material Theme Builder</a> 从图像创建配色方案时，请检查是否已选中偏好的配色方案。</li><li>探索高级自定义</li></ul>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altTex